things-ts-sdk
=============

This is an independent TypeScript implementation of the Things Cloud sync protocol. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by or sponsored by Cultured Code GmbH & Co. KG. "Things" is a trademark of its owner.
The protocol is undocumented and was reverse engineered by others; it can change without notice.

The behaviour, test vectors and the protocol knowledge in this project follow the Go SDK
https://github.com/arthursoares/things-cloud-sdk (MIT License), itself a continuation of
https://github.com/nicolai86/things-cloud-sdk (MIT License).

